      "about": {
        "title": "Black outside, cedar inside",
        "lede": "The Neptune pairs a modern black shell with a classic red cedar sauna room.",
        "items": [
          [
            "A glass front wall",
            "The whole front is glass, so the yard becomes the view. The glass door is on the side wall."
          ],
          [
            "Room for six",
            "Inside it is 77\" wide and 103\" deep, with back benches plus a long lower bench down the side."
          ],
          [
            "Wood or electric",
            "It is big enough for a wood-burning stove as well as an electric heater."
          ],
          [
            "Built properly",
            "SPF framing, tongue-and-groove red cedar inside, clear cedar benches and an EPDM membrane roof, finished in black metal or cedar siding."
          ]
        ]
      },
